@startuml
title UML State Machine Diagram (Digidoclocker)

[*] --> UserType

state UserType <<choice>>
UserType --> Registration : [Citizen]
UserType --> Login : [Registered Citizen]

state Registration
Registration : entry / Get the Registration Details
Registration : if invalid -> end
Registration : save user's information after success

state Login
Login : entry / Get username and password
Login : continue if successful

state Citizen
Citizen : upload documents
Citizen : view profile
Citizen : apply for certificate
Citizen : continue uploading documents if needed
Citizen : apply for multiple certificates and reapply after sending a request to the issuer
Citizen : request certificates for verification (Registrars)
Citizen : end session once done with actions

state Registered Citizen
Registered Citizen : login
Registered Citizen : manage profile
Registered Citizen : logout after completing any action

@enduml
